@startuml
title Skill Discovery & Execution (Electron IPC)

participant "InspectorView (React)" as VIEW
participant "IPC Handlers" as IPC
participant "InspectorService" as IS
participant "RunOrchestrator" as RO
participant "Engine Adapter" as ADAPT
participant "CLI Tool" as CLI

== Skill/Agent Browsing ==
VIEW -> IPC: ipcRenderer.invoke('inspector:list', { path })
IPC -> IS: listDirectory(path)
IS -> IS: path traversal validation\n(reject '..' / symlink escape)
IS -> IPC: Return FileEntry[]
IPC --> VIEW: display in file browser tree

== Skill Injection into Run ==
RO -> IS: resolveSkills(agentName)
IS -> IS: List /skills and /agents directories
IS --> RO: matched SKILL.md paths

RO -> ADAPT: execute_run(prompt, { skillPaths })
ADAPT -> IS: readFile(skillPath + '/SKILL.md')
IS --> ADAPT: SKILL.md content
note right: Read-only access via\nInspectorService

ADAPT -> ADAPT: Inject SKILL.md content into prompt context
ADAPT -> CLI: spawn(engine, ['--include', skillDir, '-p', prompt])
CLI --> ADAPT: CLI output
ADAPT --> RO: Final result
RO --> IPC: publish 'run:completed'
IPC --> VIEW: update UI with result

@enduml
